---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="AI Infrastructure · AI-LAB">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-16 space-y-10">
    <header class="rounded-3xl border border-cyan-500/30 bg-gradient-to-br from-zinc-900 via-zinc-950 to-black p-10">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-black text-white">AI-LAB Infrastructure</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-xl leading-9 text-zinc-300">
        Arquitectura técnica completa del AI-LAB: runtime cognitivo distribuido, observabilidad en tiempo real,
        MCP Semantic Gateway, memoria gobernada y publicación segura.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Capas de infraestructura -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400 mb-6">Capas de Infraestructura</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400">1. Access Layer</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Cloudflare Tunnel + Zero Trust + Traefik reverse proxy. Sin puertos entrantes abiertos. Acceso público y privado segmentado.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">2. Agent Layer</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">OpenCode como agente externo consumiendo MCP tools vía SSH tunnel. Futura expansión a LAN controlada con token.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400">3. MCP Semantic Gateway</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Servidor read-only en 127.0.0.1:8091. 3 tools expuestas: ailab_status, ailab_runtime_health, ailab_route_preview. Streamable HTTP transport. 13/13 tests.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-yellow-400">4. Runtime API Layer</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Runtime API Layer: Gateway (:8008), Router (:8083), Live API (:8084), Docs (:4322), Metrics (:3010). 6 systemd services con auto-restart.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400">5. Model Nodes</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">3 nodos LM Studio (2 online, 1 offline esperado). RX9070 (.50) con 4 modelos, .250 con 6 modelos. Gateway backend en 192.168.1.50:1234/v1.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400">6. Memory / Qdrant</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">8 colecciones Qdrant con políticas de retención. Cognitive history, routing history, incidents, agent knowledge. Memory governance policy implementada.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400">7. GitNexus / Code Intelligence</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Análisis estructural del código gobernado. Blast-radius, dependencias, change policy para runtime crítico. openai_gateway.py: risk HIGH.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400">8. Observability</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Prometheus + Grafana + Loki. 8 dashboards, 14+ métricas personalizadas. Cognitive health, shutdown metrics, memory injection telemetry.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-yellow-400">9. Governance / Policies</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Incident governance schema, memory governance policy, GitNexus runtime change policy, cognitive health layer, SLO enforcement.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400">10. Documentation / Blog</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Astro 6 + Starlight + Tailwind 4. Blog técnico, docs vivo, runbooks, ADRs, incidentes. Publicación dual público/privado.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-black/30 p-6">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400">11. Storage</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">/opt/ai-lab para codigo y repo versionado. /mnt/ai-models/ai-lab para logs, backups systemd, auditorias, snapshots y staging.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stack Tecnológico -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400 mb-6">Stack Tecnológico 2026</h2>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 mb-3">Runtime / Backend</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• Python 3.14.x en /opt/ai-lab/.venv</li>
            <li>• OpenAI-compatible Gateway :8008 (FastAPI)</li>
            <li>• AI-LAB Router :8083 (FastAPI)</li>
            <li>• systemd services: ailab-gateway, ailab-router, ailab-mcp-semantic-gateway, ailab-live-api, ailab-docs, ailab-metrics</li>
            <li>• Live API :8084 (estado/topologia Docker y GPU)</li>
            <li>• Docs Astro :4322 (ailab-docs.service, 255 paginas, 11s build)</li>
            <li>• Metrics dashboard :3010 (Next.js SSR)</li>
            <li>• LM Studio nodes (192.168.1.50 RX9070, 192.168.1.250)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 mb-3">MCP / Agent Layer</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• MCP Python SDK / Streamable HTTP</li>
            <li>• ailab-mcp-semantic-gateway :8091 (3 tools read-only)</li>
            <li>• OpenCode Windows integration vía SSH tunnel</li>
            <li>• Futuro: AILAB_MCP_TOKEN + LAN controlled mode</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400 mb-3">Memory / Vector</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• Qdrant (8 colecciones auditadas y gobernadas)</li>
            <li>• cognitive_history, routing_history, incidents</li>
            <li>• ai_lab_memory, agent_knowledge</li>
            <li>• Memory governance policy implementada</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-yellow-400 mb-3">Governance</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• GitNexus: análisis estructural de código</li>
            <li>• GitNexus governed runtime change policy</li>
            <li>• Incident governance schema</li>
            <li>• Memory governance policy</li>
            <li>• Runtime stability checkpoints y tags</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400 mb-3">Observability</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• Prometheus + Grafana + Loki</li>
            <li>• Cognitive health metrics</li>
            <li>• Shutdown metrics (503 durante graceful stop)</li>
            <li>• Memory injection telemetry</li>
            <li>• Gateway latency p50/p95</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 mb-3">Docs / Frontend</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• Astro 6 + Starlight + React 19 + Tailwind 4</li>
            <li>• Blog técnico y documentación viva</li>
            <li>• Cloudflare Pages + Tunnel</li>
            <li>• Split público/privado vía Zero Trust</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Seguridad -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400 mb-6">Seguridad</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-black/30 p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 font-bold">MCP Binding</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">127.0.0.1 exclusivo. Sin exposición LAN. Acceso OpenCode por SSH tunnel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-black/30 p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 font-bold">No Secrets in Logs</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Tokens, prompts completos y datos sensibles no se almacenan en logs del MCP gateway.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-black/30 p-5">
          <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 font-bold">Zero Trust</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-zinc-400">Cloudflare Access + Tunnel. Sin puertos SSH/RDP abiertos a Internet.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Estado actual vs Roadmap -->
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 p-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400 mb-6">Estado actual vs Roadmap</h2>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-950/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 mb-3">✓ Implementado</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• MCP Semantic Gateway (3 tools, 13/13 tests)</li>
            <li>• OpenCode Windows MCP integration (SSH tunnel)</li>
            <li>• Qdrant memory governance policy</li>
            <li>• Memory injection telemetry</li>
            <li>• Incident governance schema</li>
            <li>• Cognitive health layer</li>
            <li>• GitNexus governed runtime change policy</li>
            <li>• Gateway graceful shutdown</li>
            <li>• OpenCode skills sync (44 skills)</li>
            <li>• Router/ialab docs duplicate unit cleanup</li>
            <li>• Auxiliary storage (/mnt/ai-models/ai-lab)</li>
            <li>• Live API systemd hardening and audit</li>
            <li>• Sudo password sanitized from all runbooks</li>
            <li>• Docs build (255 pages, 11s)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-yellow-500/30 bg-yellow-950/10 p-6">
          <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-yellow-400 mb-3">◇ Roadmap / Pendiente</p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-400 text-sm">
            <li>• AILAB_MCP_TOKEN + LAN controlled mode</li>
            <li>• Tools semánticas reales (sommelier, analyze_label, price_estimate)</li>
            <li>• Diagnóstico ailab-router/auto</li>
            <li>• Rioja Marketplace integration</li>
            <li>• Multi-GPU runtime scheduler</li>
            <li>• Hyper-V checkpoint (operator action)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </section>
</Layout>
